---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
const base = '';
---

<BaseLayout title="Refund Policy" description="ThesisArcPro Payment and Refund Policy">
  <Header />

  <main>
    <section class="policy-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Payment and Refund Policy</h1>
        <p>Last updated: July 2026</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="policy-content">
      <div class="container policy-inner">

        <div class="policy-section">
          <h2>Overview</h2>
          <p>At ThesisArcPro, we take pride in delivering high-quality academic consulting and educational support, maintaining a high level of client satisfaction. Most of our Customers return to our platform to place subsequent orders. In the rare cases where something goes wrong, we offer a transparent and fair Refund Policy.</p>
          <p>Our goal is to maintain mutual understanding between the Expert and the Customer. ThesisArcPro is accountable for delivering the Product on time and according to the instructions specified by the Customer in the Order. If the Expert fails to meet commitments under the Order, the Customer has the right to a full or partial refund in accordance with this policy.</p>
          <p>AI tools, guidance materials, and plagiarism-checking tools provided as complimentary resources are free of charge. As these services do not involve financial transactions, they are not subject to this Refund Policy, and no refunds apply to them.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-section">
          <h2>General Principles</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Platform Role:</strong> ThesisArcPro serves as an educational consulting platform connecting Customers with independent Experts. ThesisArcPro does not act as a direct party to individual contracts formed outside the platform guidelines.</li>
            <li><strong>Consumer Protections:</strong> Refund eligibility respects local consumer protection laws where applicable. Customers can initiate a request via customer support or directly through their dashboard.</li>
            <li><strong>Order Instructions:</strong> Customers are eligible for a refund if the delivered Product strays significantly from the initial project requirements specified at the time of purchase.</li>
            <li><strong>Personal Balance & Promotional Funds:</strong> Only real funds added through supported payment gateways are eligible for withdrawal or refund. Any bonus credits, promotional incentives, or affiliate earnings added by ThesisArcPro are non-withdrawable, non-transferable, and may only be applied toward future Orders.</li>
            <li><strong>Discounts & Promo Codes:</strong> In the event of a refund or chargeback, only the net amount actually paid after applying promotional discounts will be refunded. Discount codes hold no cash value.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-section">
          <h2>Refund Scenarios & Qualifications</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>1. No Expert Has Been Assigned Yet:</strong> If no Expert has taken or been assigned to your project, you are entitled to a 100% full refund.</li>
            <li><strong>2. Late Cancellation:</strong> If you cancel an order after an Expert has been confirmed and work has commenced, a 70%–100% refund may be issued. ThesisArcPro reserves the right to retain a portion of the payment to fairly compensate the Expert for completed work. If the final deliverable has already been uploaded, the request will be reviewed as a Disputed Claim.</li>
            <li><strong>3. Late Submission:</strong> If the final product is delivered past the agreed deadline, appropriate compensation will be discussed directly with the Customer. Refunds or adjustments do not apply if delay occurs because the Customer failed to provide essential instructions, files, or clarifications in a timely manner.</li>
            <li><strong>4. Disputed Claims & Quality Oversight:</strong> If you are dissatisfied with the quality of the delivered work, you may file a dispute. Our Quality Assurance Department will independently review the order details, chat logs, and deliverables to determine a fair resolution or partial refund amount.</li>
            <li><strong>5. Accidental Duplicate Orders:</strong> If you accidentally place a duplicate order, notify support immediately. If an Expert has not been assigned, a 100% refund will be issued. If an Expert has already accepted the duplicate order, standard cancellation fees apply.</li>
            <li><strong>6. Duplicate Invoices:</strong> If technical glitches result in duplicate billing for a single transaction, contact support with both receipts for an immediate, full refund on the extra charge.</li>
            <li><strong>7. Content Authenticity & Originality Issues:</strong> If you receive work containing unauthorized plagiarized content, submit an official verification report from a recognized detection tool. Validated claims are eligible for a full or partial refund.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-section">
          <h2>Ineligibility for Refunds</h2>
          <p>A refund will not be issued under the following circumstances:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Product Usage:</strong> You have downloaded, cited, or utilized the material in a subsequent order or project (minimum 70% release of funds to the Expert).</li>
            <li><strong>Academic Grades & Admissions:</strong> ThesisArcPro provides secondary research, structural editing, and reference materials intended strictly for educational and self-study purposes. We do not guarantee specific academic grades, exam pass rates, degree completion, or institutional admissions.</li>
            <li><strong>Unclear / Changed Instructions for Editing/Proofreading:</strong> For editing or proofreading services, Customers must supply clean source files and precise guidelines. The platform is not responsible for errors stemming from flawed original source files provided by the Customer.</li>
            <li><strong>Bypassing Platform Policies:</strong> Orders placed outside the official ThesisArcPro platform or transactions conducted via third-party communication channels violate our terms and forfeit refund protection.</li>
            <li><strong>Expired Policy Window:</strong> Refund requests submitted more than 6 months (180 days) after the initial transaction date cannot be processed.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-section">
          <h2>Refund Processing & Timelines</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Refund requests take up to <strong>5 business days</strong> to process.</li>
            <li>Refunds are issued directly to the card/method used for purchase.</li>
            <li>Refunds cannot be issued more than <strong>6 months</strong> after transaction date.</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>Processing Time:</strong> Once approved by Quality Assurance, refunds typically process within 3 to 5 business days. Processing speeds are subject to your financial institution's guidelines.</p>
          <p><strong>Payment Routing:</strong> Refunds can only be returned to the original payment method utilized for the purchase.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-section">
          <h2>Chargebacks & Account Suspensions</h2>
          <p>Initiating an unauthorized chargeback or payment dispute through your bank or payment provider will result in the immediate suspension of your ThesisArcPro account. The Customer agrees to cover any chargeback processing fees incurred by the platform during the dispute resolution process.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-section">
          <h2>Account Inactivity & Deactivation</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Inactive Accounts:</strong> Accounts inactive for 180 consecutive days with zero balance activity may be marked for archival in accordance with data retention regulations.</li>
            <li><strong>Account Deactivation:</strong> You may request account deactivation at any time via Profile Settings → Deactivate Account. A 14-day hold window applies, during which you must reach out to support to resolve any remaining balances.</li>
            <li><strong>Termination for Cause:</strong> Accounts closed due to severe policy breaches, malicious acts, or fraud forfeit any right to pending funds or refunds.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-section">
          <h2>Payments, Security & Tax Responsibility</h2>
          <p>ThesisArcPro partners with secure, tier-1 third-party payment processors (utilizing SSL/TLS encryption). ThesisArcPro does not store full credit card numbers or sensitive financial credentials on its servers. Customers and Experts are responsible for any applicable local taxes or transaction fees associated with service consumption or payout withdrawals.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-section">
          <h2>Materials & Intellectual Property Post-Refund</h2>
          <p>Upon issuance of a full refund or order cancellation, the Customer surrenders all rights to review, cite, or utilize any draft materials or deliverables provided under that order. ThesisArcPro retains ownership of cancelled materials and reserves the right to index them within internal quality databases.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-section">
          <h2>Policy Updates</h2>
          <p>ThesisArcPro reserves the right to update this Payment and Refund Policy periodically. Significant changes will be announced on our website or communicated via email prior to implementation.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-section">
          <h2>Contact Us</h2>
          <p>For any questions regarding this Refund Policy:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Email: <a href="mailto:thesisarcpro069@gmail.com">thesisarcpro069@gmail.com</a></li>
            <li>WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/16624002088">+1 (662) 400-2088</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.policy-hero { background: var(--navy); padding: 10rem 0 4rem; text-align: center; }
.policy-hero h1 { color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
.policy-hero p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-size: 0.9rem; }
.policy-content { padding: var(--section-padding); background: var(--off-white); }
.policy-inner { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
.policy-section { background: rgb(229, 234, 238); border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); }
.policy-section h2 { color: var(--navy); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold); }
.policy-section p { color: var(--text-mid); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.policy-section ul { color: var(--text-mid); line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.5rem; }
.policy-section ul li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
.policy-section a { color: var(--gold); text-decoration: none; }
.policy-section a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>